    "turn_text": "Yeah, that's very true, sir. I thought all the questions were pretty accurate, but I can understand that coming from you who has some narcissism that you're battling and other issues and everything with your wife being so public. And I just, you know, I wish you the burst, which is like a mixture of best and the worst because I don't hate anybody, but you really tested me this last four years, sir. So thank you.",
