    "turn_idx": 449,
    "turn_text": "You're very welcome. And I'm surprised nobody asked about what a great job I did with COVID. And I know Sleepy Joe is going to try to take credit when we get those 500,000 dead, when we reach five, because that's known as gold. You know, when you sell 500,000 records, it's called a gold record.",
